  "details": "Over the past few days, I’ve received multiple reports from Quest 2 players saying that VRChat crashes while loading my world Jetski Rush (https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_2ad5bb30-adf7-4de1-ba50-ae9b6b4689fe/info). There’s no error message, the client just closes during the loading screen.\n\nI haven’t updated the world recently, and it was working fine before. I tried to reproduce the issue myself but wasn’t able to. The world loads and runs normally for me and several other players.\n\nWe don’t have access to the logs from affected users, so it’s difficult to pinpoint the cause. It might be related to a recent VRChat update, since the crashes only started happening recently without any changes on our side.",
